### Примеры запросов (IntelliJ IDEA HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client)
@host = http://localhost:8080

### Регистрация покупателя
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "ivan", "email": "ivan@example.com", "password": "secret123", "fullName": "Иван Петров"}

### Вход (скопируйте token из ответа)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "ivan", "password": "secret123"}

### Вход администратора
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "admin", "password": "admin123"}

### Кто я
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Каталог (публично): поиск, фильтр по цене, сортировка, пагинация
GET {{host}}/api/products?q=phone&minPrice=10000&maxPrice=200000&sort=price,desc&page=0&size=5

### Категории
GET {{host}}/api/categories

### Добавить адрес
POST {{host}}/api/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"label": "Дом", "city": "Москва", "street": "Тверская, 1", "zipCode": "101000"}

### Оформить заказ
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"addressId": 1, "items": [{"productId": 3, "quantity": 1}, {"productId": 6, "quantity": 2}]}

### Оплатить заказ
POST {{host}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId": 1, "method": "CARD"}

### Менеджер: отправить заказ
PATCH {{host}}/api/orders/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "SHIPPED"}

### Отзыв о товаре
POST {{host}}/api/products/3/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"rating": 5, "comment": "Отличный телефон"}

### Health (публично) и метрики (ADMIN)
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

###
GET {{host}}/actuator/metrics/markethub.orders.created
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
